Package: helix-relay
Version: __VERSION__
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: nodejs (>= 18)
Maintainer: Helix Project <noreply@example.com>
Description: Helix DHT rendezvous + circuit-relay anchor
 A standalone, always-on libp2p node that lets NAT'd Helix peers get a
 circuit-relay-v2 reservation (so strangers can dial them) and lets any Helix
 peer find the network via the public DHT without needing its own bootstrap
 peer. Ships no user-facing functionality of its own - pure network
 infrastructure.
